!Sample_molecule_ch1 = total RNA
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Small RNA library from X.tropicalis egg extract. Xenopus egg extract was prepared by crushing mature eggs laid in frog water in a centrifuge and pulling cytoplasmic layer with a needle and syringe.  The egg extract was mixed with Trizol to obtain total RNA. Small RNAs were ligated with linkers and converted to cDNA by reverse transcription. cDNA library was amplified by PCR.
