!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Small RNA library from a single X.tropicalis egg. A single de-jellied egg was mixed with Trizol to obtain total RNA. Small RNAs were ligated with linkers and converted to cDNA by reverse transcription. cDNA library was amplified by PCR.
